  "title": "Vertiv completes acquisition of Great Lakes Data Racks & Cabinets",
  "summary": "Vertiv Holdings Co (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure, today announced the successful completion of its previously reported intent to acquire the Great Lakes Data Racks & Cabinets family of companies (\"Great Lakes\"), a leading manufacturer of innovative data rack enclosures and integrated infrastructure solutions. The ~ $200 million acquisition expands Vertiv’s rack, cabinet and integration solutions for white space applications.",
